# Phase 8a (docs/phase8a-brief.md 3.3, 7.6, 8): the splash funnel. A probe
# splashf() (what any stock code path would call) is suppressed in the
# shell: the screen is unchanged, the text is logged, and the line reaches
# /.rockbox/ipodui.log at the next flush.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p8a-splash.script
# needs: library
# trace: splash
# trace: log
# same: before after
# log: splash-suppressed probe
# nolog: splash-pass
# expect-file: /.rockbox/ipodui.log splash-suppressed probe
#
# Needs P (splash.c funnel) and U2 (uilog.c). `storage_idle` runs the
# stock storage-idle notifies; the log flush hangs off DISK_EVENT_SPINUP
# (brief 3.3), so if the sim never posts it the flush line stays absent and
# this script FAILS loudly: U2 must add a sim trigger (or flush on idle).

wait 4000
rm_file /.rockbox/ipodui.log
key SELECT 50       # Music (a screen to compare)
wait 1000
shot before
splash_probe probe
wait 1500
shot after          # == before
storage_idle
wait 1500
quit
